    30	- His Path works inside the quiet ground. Every other Arbiter in the party fails at the same stride.
    31	- The Compact surveys quiet ground, from the kit's ledger: a radius line, an index of forty-one kinds, the stroke-and-bar mark, and "third site confirmed on bearing".
    32	- The faceless faction has reached twice, on paper (a completion report naming the crew that walks out) and in person on the Stair's rim. Asset-restriction is pending.
