+- Shadow is unused. Karis's hypothesis remains unstated. Teague's crew remains unnamed. No new proper name appears. The prose is season-blind and uses yards and feet. Lira's arm is inert at the Hall; the coda no longer re-explains; the trial is never counted; the case is shut; and there is no decoding.
